/* components/share-sheet —— 统一分享弹层（5:4 卡片预览 + 长图预览 + 图片/微信卡片两种分享） */
.ss { padding-bottom: 4rpx; }

.ss-tabs {
  display: flex; gap: 8rpx; padding: 4rpx; margin-bottom: 16rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx; background: var(--md-surface-container-high, #ECE6DA);
}
.ss-tab {
  flex: 1; min-height: 60rpx; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 999rpx; font-size: 23rpx; color: var(--md-on-surface-variant, #5C6860);
}
.ss-tab--on {
  background: var(--md-surface-container-lowest, #FFFFFF);
  color: var(--md-on-surface, #303A35); font-weight: 600;
}

.ss-prevwrap { margin-bottom: 20rpx; }
.ss-prev {
  display: block; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 20rpx; border: 1rpx solid var(--md-outline-variant, #E7DED0);
  background: var(--md-surface-container-low, #F7F3EA);
}
.ss-prev--ph {
  height: 300rpx; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border-style: dashed;
}
.ss-ph { font-size: 24rpx; color: var(--md-on-surface-variant, #5C6860); }
.ss-for {
  margin-top: 12rpx; font-size: 23rpx; color: var(--md-on-surface-variant, #5C6860);
  overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.ss-hint { margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 21rpx; color: var(--md-error, #A2543E); }

.ss-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12rpx; }
.ss-opt {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16rpx;
  width: 100%; min-height: 104rpx; margin: 0; padding: 16rpx 20rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; line-height: 1.3;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--md-outline-variant, #E7DED0); border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: var(--md-surface-container-lowest, #FFFFFF); color: var(--md-on-surface, #303A35);
}
.ss-opt--btn { width: 100% !important; margin-left: 0 !important; margin-right: 0 !important; font-size: inherit; }
.ss-opt--btn::after { border: 0; }
.ss-opt--tap { background: var(--md-primary-container, #D9EAE3); }
.ss-ico {
  flex: none; width: 64rpx; height: 64rpx; border-radius: 16rpx;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--md-on-primary-container, #214C41); background: var(--md-primary-container, #D9EAE3);
}
.ss-ico--card { color: var(--md-on-tertiary-container, #5A4226); background: var(--md-tertiary-container, #F3E7D3); }
.ss-bd { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.ss-t { font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 600; color: var(--md-on-surface, #303A35); }
.ss-s { margin-top: 4rpx; font-size: 21rpx; color: var(--md-on-surface-variant, #5C6860); }
.ss-tip { margin-top: 18rpx; font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--md-on-surface-variant, #5C6860); }
